        a("lb_B1103", "Поза кошки лицом вниз", "Downward Facing Cat Pose", "Adho Mukha Marjarasana", p(358, 314, 271, 161, 270, 180, 210, 270, 180, 210, 271, 164, 341), "Спина округлена, пальцы ног вытянуты", "Спина округлена, пальцы ног вытянуты. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: пупок. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1103.", "Toes pointing away from the head. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Nabhi, Nabhicakre, or Nabi Chakra (belly button). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1103.", "B1103"),
        a("lb_B1104", "Поза кошки: руки вперёд, раскачивание назад", "Downward Facing Cat Pose", "Adho Mukha Marjarasana", p(345, 310, 299, 90, 290, 170, 200, 290, 170, 200, 300, 90, 330), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: пупок. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1104.", "Arms straight to the front, fingertips to the floor; rocking back, toes curled in. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Nabhi, Nabhicakre, or Nabi Chakra (belly button). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1104.", "B1104"),
        a("lb_B1105", "Поза тигра: колено ко лбу", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(358, 314, 271, 161, 5, 235, 265, 270, 180, 210, 271, 164, 341), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: пупок. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1105.", "Knee to the forehead. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Nabhi, Nabhicakre, or Nabi Chakra (belly button). Also known as: Cow Pose Modification (Bitilasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1105.", "B1105"),
        a("lb_B1106", "Поза тигра: колено к плечу своей стороны", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(0, 324, 279, 170, 5, 238, 266, 270, 180, 210, 281, 167, 345), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: кончик носа. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1106.", "Knee to the shoulder on the same side. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Nasagrai or Nasagre (nose). Also known as: Cow Pose Modification (Bitilasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1106.", "B1106"),
        a("lb_B1107", "Поза тигра: колено к противоположному трицепсу", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(0, 325, 270, 174, 5, 239, 266, 270, 180, 210, 277, 159, 345), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд, скручивание", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд, скручивание. Взгляд: кончик носа. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1107.", "Knee to the opposite tricep. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend, twist. Gaze: Nasagrai or Nasagre (nose). Also known as: Cow Pose Modification (Bitilasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1107.", "B1107"),
        a("lb_B1108", "Поза тигра: плечо под коленом", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(353, 344, 280, 194, 355, 270, 296, 270, 180, 270, 279, 196, 344), "Пальцы задней ноги подогнуты", "Пальцы задней ноги подогнуты. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: кончик носа или пальцы ног. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1108.", "Shoulder to the back of the knee; back leg, toes curled in. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Nasagrai or Nasagre (nose), Padayoragrai or Padayoragre (toes/feet). Also known as: Cow Pose Modification (Bitilasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1108.", "B1108"),
        a("lb_B1109", "Поза тигра: одна кисть у сердца", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(353, 344, 249, 249, 355, 270, 296, 270, 180, 210, 210, 29, 344), "Колено на плече", "Колено на плече. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), наклон вперёд. Взгляд: кончик носа или межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1109.", "One hand to the heart 1. back of the knee to the shoulder, leg bent 2. back of the knee to the shoulder, leg straight. Type: standing (on hands and knees), forward bend. Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows), Nasagrai or Nasagre. Also known as: Cow Pose Modification (Bitilasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1109.", "B1109"),
        a("lb_B1110", "Наклон «собака мордой вверх» на четвереньках", "Upward Facing Dog Pose Tilt", "Urdhva Mukha Shvanasana Tilt", p(7, 50, 291, 312, 270, 180, 210, 270, 180, 210, 287, 318, 24), "Прогиб, взгляд вверх", "Прогиб, взгляд вверх. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб. Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1110.", "Type: standing (on hands and knees), backbend. Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows. D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1110.", "B1110"),
        a("lb_B1111", "Поза тигра: нога прямо, пальцы вытянуты", "Tiger Pose", "Vyaghrasana", p(9, 42, 277, 322, 160, 160, 190, 270, 180, 210, 275, 325, 21), "Прогиб", "Прогиб. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб. Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1111.", "One leg straight out, toes pointing away from the head. Type: standing (on hands and knees), backbend. Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows). Also known as: Balancing Table Pose Modification (Niralamba Dandayamana Bharmanasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1111.", "B1111"),
        a("lb_B1112", "Поза тигра без опоры: захват стопы снизу своей стороны", "Unsupported Tiger Pose", "Niralamba Vyaghrasana", p(10, 47, 162, 169, 190, 70, 100, 270, 180, 210, 292, 310, 25), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб. Взгляд: большие пальцы рук. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1112.", "Grabbing onto the foot with under-head grip on the same side. Type: standing (on hands and knees), backbend. Gaze: Angushtamadhye or Angushta Ma Dyai (thumbs). Also known as: One-Legged Bow Pose from All Fours (Eka Pada Dhanurasana), Balancing Table Pose Modification (Dandayamana Bharmanasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1112.", "B1112"),
        a("lb_B1113", "Поза тигра без опоры: захват голени противоположной рукой", "Unsupported Tiger Pose", "Niralamba Vyaghrasana", p(10, 47, 295, 289, 190, 70, 100, 270, 180, 210, 191, 192, 25), "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб", "Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб. Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1113.", "Grabbing onto the shin with under-head grip on the opposite side. Type: standing (on hands and knees), backbend. Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows). Also known as: One-Legged Bow Pose from All Fours (Eka Pada Dhanurasana), Balancing Table Pose Modification (Dandayamana Bharmanasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1113.", "B1113"),
        a("lb_B1114", "Поза тигра без опоры: захват стопы через голову", "Unsupported Tiger Pose", "Niralamba Vyaghrasana", p(19, 82, 70, 160, 170, 20, 50, 270, 180, 210, 295, 288, 45), "Стопа к голове", "Стопа к голове. Тип: стоя (on hands and knees), прогиб. Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1114.", "Grabbing onto the foot with overhead grip on the same side, foot toward the head 1. toes pointing away from the head 2. toes curled in. Type: standing (on hands and knees), backbend. Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows). Also known as: Balancing Table Pose Modification (Dandayamana Bharmanasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1114.", "B1114"),
