        a("lb_B1116", "Поза коровы на предплечьях", "Cow Pose", "Bitilasana", p(350, 354, 196, 318, 270, 180, 210, 270, 180, 210, 194, 319, 350), "Тип: стоя (on forearms and knees)", "Тип: стоя (on forearms and knees). Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1116.", "Forearms to the floor. Type: standing (on forearms and knees). Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows). Also known as: Table Pose Modification (Bharmanasana). D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1116.", "B1116"),
