        a("lb_B1196", "Поза Васиштхи на предплечье: верхняя нога скрещена", "Pose Dedicated to Sage Vasishta", "Vasishtasana", p(165, 165, 263, 202, 341, 341, 0, 330, 325, 321, 26, 293, 165), "Стопа на полу", "Стопа на полу. Тип: foreбаланс на руках, кор. Взгляд: вверх. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1196.", "Forearm on the floor; top leg crossed over, foot flat on the floor; top hand by the bottom hip socket. Type: forearm balance, core. Gaze: Urdhva or Antara Drishti (up to the sky). Also known as: Dolphin Side Plank Modification. D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1196.", "B1196"),
