        a("lb_B1679", "Обратный стол на одной ноге", "One-Legged Half Eastern Intense Stretch Pose", "Eka Pada Ardha Purvottanasana", p(180, 196, 270, 270, 60, 60, 150, 327, 279, 0, 270, 270, 180), "Нога прямая вверх", "Нога прямая вверх. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1679.", "D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1679.", "B1679"),
        a("lb_B1680", "Васиштха на предплечье в обратном столе", "Sage Vasistha on the Forearm", "Eka Pada Ardha Purvottanasana in Vasishtasana", p(180, 196, 270, 270, 30, 235, 12, 327, 279, 0, 270, 270, 180), "Стопа к колену", "Стопа к колену. Тип: стоя (on the forearm and the foot). Взгляд: межбровье. Д. Лакерда, «2100 Asanas», № 1680.", "Both knees bent, foot to the knee. Type: standing (on the forearm and the foot). Gaze: Bhrumadhye or Ajna Chakra (third eye, between the eyebrows). Also known as: One-Legged Reverse Table Top in Pose Dedicated to Sage Vasistha on the Forearm, One-Legged Half Reverse Plank Top in Pose Dedicated to Sage Vasistha on the Forearm. D. Lacerda, “2100 Asanas”, No. 1680.", "B1680"),
